 사용하려고 합니다.\n계획 잘 세워서 유용하게 사용하겠습니다. ^^","h":2,"b":false,"s":"12598575631","p":["https://phinf.pstatic.net/checkout.phinf/20251106_221/1762398775181KfgL5_JPEG/KakaoTalk_20251106_121233109_01.jpg","https://phinf.pstatic.net/checkout.phinf/20251106_245/1762398785798HydAL_JPEG/KakaoTalk_20251106_121233109_04.jpg","https://phinf.pstatic.net/checkout.phinf/20251106_254/1762398786124hAWHc_JPEG/KakaoTalk_20251106_121233109_02.jpg","https://phinf.pstatic.net/checkout.phinf/20251106_140/1762398785785KFTwu_JPEG/KakaoTalk_20251106_121233109_03.jpg","https://phinf.pstatic.net/checkout.phinf/20251106_147/1762398785696duzox_JPEG/KakaoTalk_20251106_121233109.jpg"]}]